                                                                                   <http://www.semanticweb.org/mac/ontologies/2025/10/cybersecurity/alignmentType> "aligned" .


###  http://www.semanticweb.org/mac/ontologies/2025/10/cybersecurity/ModerateCriticalityAsset
<http://www.semanticweb.org/mac/ontologies/2025/10/cybersecurity/ModerateCriticalityAsset> rdf:type owl:Class ;
