                                                                           rdfs:subClassOf <http://www.semanticweb.org/mac/ontologies/2025/10/cybersecurity/Vulnerability> ;
                                                                           <http://www.semanticweb.org/mac/ontologies/2025/10/cybersecurity/alignmentType> "aligned" .


